# third-party art packs whose licences restrict redistribution stay on disk only.
# The voxel rooms (Tiny Voxel Dungeon by Max Parata, free for any project) are published.
docs/art/*
!docs/art/rooms/
# FreePixel characters ship inside the built game (allowed); the raw source copies in macos/Assets stay private
!docs/art/wizard_idle.png
!docs/art/wizard_walk.png
!docs/art/ghost_walk.png
# Dark Horror Asset Pack tiles (free with attribution; baked into ground/props/cracks) and the author's own AI-generated penguin
!docs/art/ground.png
!docs/art/cracks.png
!docs/art/props.png
!docs/art/penguin.png
macos/Assets/*
!macos/Assets/rooms/
!macos/Assets/penguin.png
web/public/art/
